#: desktop.cc:779
msgid ""
"Could not log out properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing Ctrl+Alt+Backspace; note, however, that your current session will not "
"be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Sessidän döres çığıp bulmí.\n"
"Sessi idäräçese belän totaşılıp bulmí. Xäzer inde Ctrl+Alt+Backspace östenä "
"basıp, köç belän çığıp qararğa qala; läkin bel, köçläp çıqqan çaqta biredäge "
"sessi saqlanmí qalır."

